    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the best special forces unit of the Galactic Union. Your task is to land on the desert planet of the Long-eared and protect them from the followers of the Cult of the Iron God. Destroy all the enemies on your way. The main task is to find and destroy the huge Titan combat robots. And don't forget to keep an eye on the sand, there may be creatures scarier than cyborgs hiding under it </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454600/extras/e8a2831d2e63b9ed65465c6dd86e0298.poster.avif?t=1754910402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454600/extras/e8a2831d2e63b9ed65465c6dd86e0298.webm?t=1754910402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454600/extras/e8a2831d2e63b9ed65465c6dd86e0298.mp4?t=1754910402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op up to 4 players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight dangerous creatures of the planet XBS-87 with your friends! Develop a strategy, use different skills and weapons, mix play styles and free the galaxy from the cruel followers of the Iron God cult </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team has 5 attempts to capture the enemy city and destroy the Titan, after each attempt you choose a power-up. If you fail in 5 attempts, you start over  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454600/extras/03dd3db3d6d4b336a9b325a53360487d.poster.avif?t=1754910402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454600/extras/03dd3db3d6d4b336a9b325a53360487d.webm?t=1754910402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454600/extras/03dd3db3d6d4b336a9b325a53360487d.mp4?t=1754910402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 4 active skills at your disposal. The Engineer can build turrets. The Medic can heal the team. The Defender knows how to put up energy shields. Berserk deals massive damage to enemies for a short period of time </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map randomization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each death, the map will partially change. Don't even try to remember the way to the Titan - the desert is changeable </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sci-fi weapons and armor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Emperor is ready to provide you with the best weapons to destroy the cultists. Destroy your enemies with plasma, burn them with lasers and blast them with rockets, they deserve it! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructibilit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has a large number of destructible buildings, bridges and beams. Why not fire a rocket at the wall your friend is standing on? It's fun!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the best special forces unit of the Galactic Union. Your task is to land on the desert planet of the Long-eared and protect them from the followers of the Cult of the Iron God. Destroy all the enemies on your way. The main task is to find and destroy the huge Titan combat robots. And don't forget to keep an eye on the sand, there may be creatures scarier than cyborgs hiding under it </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454600/extras/e8a2831d2e63b9ed65465c6dd86e0298.poster.avif?t=1754910402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454600/extras/e8a2831d2e63b9ed65465c6dd86e0298.webm?t=1754910402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454600/extras/e8a2831d2e63b9ed65465c6dd86e0298.mp4?t=1754910402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op up to 4 players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight dangerous creatures of the planet XBS-87 with your friends! Develop a strategy, use different skills and weapons, mix play styles and free the galaxy from the cruel followers of the Iron God cult </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team has 5 attempts to capture the enemy city and destroy the Titan, after each attempt you choose a power-up. If you fail in 5 attempts, you start over  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454600/extras/03dd3db3d6d4b336a9b325a53360487d.poster.avif?t=1754910402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454600/extras/03dd3db3d6d4b336a9b325a53360487d.webm?t=1754910402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454600/extras/03dd3db3d6d4b336a9b325a53360487d.mp4?t=1754910402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 4 active skills at your disposal. The Engineer can build turrets. The Medic can heal the team. The Defender knows how to put up energy shields. Berserk deals massive damage to enemies for a short period of time </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map randomization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each death, the map will partially change. Don't even try to remember the way to the Titan - the desert is changeable </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sci-fi weapons and armor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Emperor is ready to provide you with the best weapons to destroy the cultists. Destroy your enemies with plasma, burn them with lasers and blast them with rockets, they deserve it! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructibilit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has a large number of destructible buildings, bridges and beams. Why not fire a rocket at the wall your friend is standing on? It's fun!</p>",
    "short_description": "Ironsand is a dynamic FPS rogue-lite. Your team lands on a desert planet of Long-eared to protect them from the followers of the Cult of the Iron God. Your opponents will be cyborgs, alien beetles and huge Titan combat robots",
